===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|en|enm|wring}}, {{m|enm|wringe}}, {{m|enm|wrynge|t=a press, especially for olives or wine}}{{nb...|wrong|otherforms=1}},<ref>{{R:MED Online|entry=wring(e|pos=''n.''(1)|noformat=1|id=MED53671}}</ref> from {{inh|en|ang|wringe}}, from {{m|ang|wringan|pos=verb}}:<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''n.''{{sup|1}}|noformat=1|id=230709|date=December 2021}}</ref> see further at [[#Etymology 1|etymology 1]].

